    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "growth = df[\n",
        "    [\n",
        "        \"年度\",\n",
        "        \"プライズ台数前年比_pct\",\n",
        "        \"プライズ売上前年比_pct\"\n",
        "    ]\n",
        "].dropna()\n",
        "\n",
        "r_growth = growth[\"プライズ台数前年比_pct\"].corr(\n",
        "    growth[\"プライズ売上前年比_pct\"]\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"増加率同士の相関係数:\", round(r_growth, 3))"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "9cmmiTlDHfJr",
        "outputId": "c6901ec2-23ed-419d-ae01-b362a8342262"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "増加率同士の相関係数: 0.482\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "plt.figure(figsize=(8, 6))\n",
        "\n",
        "plt.scatter(\n",
        "    growth[\"プライズ台数前年比_pct\"],\n",
        "    growth[\"プライズ売上前年比_pct\"]\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "plt.xlabel(\"Machine Growth Rate (%)\")\n",
        "plt.ylabel(\"Sales Growth Rate (%)\")\n",
        "plt.title(\"Machine Growth vs Sales Growth\")\n",
        "\n",
        "plt.axhline(0, linewidth=1)\n",
        "plt.axvline(0, linewidth=1)\n",
        "plt.grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
        "\n",
        "plt.show()"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
          "height": 357
        },
        "id": "4VXQuajPHtZ8",
        "outputId": "ce5f07b8-92c3-49fe-d1b3-f7b57e34ee28"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "display_data",
          "data": {
            "text/plain": [
              "<Figure size 800x600 with 1 Axes>"
            ],
            "image/png": "\n"
          },
          "metadata": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### 設置台数増加率と売上増加率の関係\n",
        "\n",
        "設置台数と売上高そのものには強い正の相関（r = 0.909）が確認されたが、\n",
        "前年比の増加率同士で分析したところ、相関係数は r = 0.482 となった。\n",
        "\n",
        "これは中程度の正の相関を示しており、\n",
        "設置台数が大きく増加した年度ほど売上高も増加する傾向はみられるものの、\n",
        "その関係は設置台数と売上高そのものを比較した場合ほど強くない。\n",
        "\n",
        "したがって、プライズゲーム市場の成長は設置台数の増加だけでは\n",
        "十分に説明できず、景品需要や設置場所、稼働率など、\n",
        "他の要因も関係している可能性がある。"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "08Yng8aIHwoP"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "from scipy.stats import linregress\n",
        "\n",
        "x_growth = growth[\"プライズ台数前年比_pct\"]\n",
        "y_growth = growth[\"プライズ売上前年比_pct\"]\n",
        "\n",
        "result_growth = linregress(x_growth, y_growth)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"傾き:\", round(result_growth.slope, 3))\n",
        "print(\"相関係数 r:\", round(result_growth.rvalue, 3))\n",
        "print(\"決定係数 R²:\", round(result_growth.rvalue**2, 3))\n",
        "print(\"p値:\", round(result_growth.pvalue, 4))"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "SyFQrM4aH8JW",
        "outputId": "843f500f-abe1-452d-a1dd-c3f68039fdd4"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "傾き: 0.605\n",
            "相関係数 r: 0.482\n",
            "決定係数 R²: 0.232\n",
            "p値: 0.1333\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "plt.figure(figsize=(8, 6))\n",
        "\n",
        "plt.scatter(x_growth, y_growth)\n",
        "\n",
        "plt.plot(\n",
        "    x_growth,\n",
        "    result_growth.intercept + result_growth.slope * x_growth\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "plt.xlabel(\"Machine Growth Rate (%)\")\n",
        "plt.ylabel(\"Sales Growth Rate (%)\")\n",
        "plt.title(\"Regression: Machine Growth vs Sales Growth\")\n",
        "\n",
        "plt.axhline(0, linewidth=1)\n",
        "plt.axvline(0, linewidth=1)\n",
        "plt.grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
        "\n",
        "plt.show()"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "n56-6oNXH-n8",
        "outputId": "2e8020e6-9eb9-45ca-ab0b-4a2185dc3951",
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
          "height": 357
        }
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "display_data",
          "data": {
            "text/plain": [
              "<Figure size 800x600 with 1 Axes>"
            ],
            "image/png": "\n"
          },
          "metadata": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### 設置台数増加率と売上増加率の回帰分析\n",
        "\n",
        "設置台数の前年比とプライズゲーム売上高の前年比について\n",
        "単回帰分析を行った。\n",
        "\n",
        "その結果、相関係数は r = 0.482 となり、\n",
        "中程度の正の相関がみられた。\n",
        "\n",
        "一方、決定係数は R² = 0.232、p値は0.1333となり、\n",
        "5%水準では統計的に有意な関係は確認できなかった。\n",
        "\n",
        "したがって、設置台数が大きく増加した年度ほど\n",
        "売上高も増加する傾向はみられるものの、\n",
        "設置台数の増加だけで短期的な売上成長を\n",
        "十分に説明することは難しいと考えられる。\n",
        "\n",
        "この結果から、プライズゲーム市場の成長には、\n",
        "設置台数以外の要因も関係している可能性がある。"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "sT-R1fzEIieU"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "import glob\n",
        "import pandas as pd\n",
        "\n",
        "csv_files = glob.glob(\"/content/*.csv\")\n",
        "\n",
        "ip_files = [\n",
        "    f for f in csv_files\n",
        "    if \"2014-2023\" in f\n",
        "]\n",
        "\n",
        "print(ip_files)\n",
        "\n",
        "ip_df = pd.read_csv(ip_files[0])\n",
        "\n",
        "ip_df.head()"
      ],
      "metadata": {
